OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds still homeless after
OL,4,Abeing evacuated from 'unsafe' flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of residents in east London
OL,7,Fremain homeless after structural
OL,8,Fdefects were discovered at an
OL,9,Faward-winning high-rise development
OL,10,Fthat was declared "at risk of sudden
OL,11,Fcollapse".
OL,13,FThe Royal Gateway, also known as Caxton
OL,14,FWorks in Canning Town, Newham, was
OL,15,Fbuilt less than 10 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
