OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds still homeless after
OL,4,Abeing evacuated from 'unsafe' flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut last month, people living there
OL,7,Fwere suddenly told to leave - some in
OL,8,Fthe middle of the night by London Fire
OL,9,FBrigade - because it was "unsafe".
OL,10,FBusinesses renting commercial spaces
OL,11,Fwere also told to evacuate their
OL,12,Fpremises.
OL,14,FEngineers identified concerns with
OL,15,Freinforced concrete "transfer slabs"
OL,16,Fsupporting the buildings - an issue
OL,17,Fthat has emerged at other London
OL,18,Fdevelopments, prompting wider scrutiny
OL,19,Fof the construction method.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
